Temperature Converter

A simple and responsive Temperature Converter website built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It allows users to convert temperatures between Celsius, Fahrenheit, and Kelvin quickly and accurately.

Features

- Convert temperatures between Celsius, Fahrenheit, and Kelvin.
- Display all three converted values simultaneously.
- Validate numeric input and show helpful error messages.
- Prevent temperatures below absolute zero.
- Clear button to reset the input and results.
- Responsive design for desktop and mobile devices.
- Clean and user-friendly interface.

Technologies Used

- HTML5 – Structure of the website.
- CSS3 – Styling, layout, and responsive design.
- JavaScript – Temperature conversion logic and input validation.

Temperature Conversion Formulas

- Celsius to Fahrenheit: (°C × 9/5) + 32
- Fahrenheit to Celsius: (°F − 32) × 5/9
- Celsius to Kelvin: °C + 273.15
- Kelvin to Celsius: K − 273.15

